# pip-audit allowlist for Finlity
#
# Format:
#   - One CVE / GHSA / PYSEC ID per line.
#   - `#` lines are comments and are skipped.
#   - Blank lines are skipped.
#   - Each ID MUST be preceded by a `# reason: ...` comment on the line above.
#
# CI loads this file via scripts/ci-pip-audit.sh and turns each ID into a
# `--ignore-vuln <id>` argument to `pip-audit`. Any vuln NOT in this file
# fails the build. Keep this list as small as possible; prefer bumping the
# offending dependency in requirements.in (then re-pinning requirements.txt)
# over allowlisting.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
